# Copy this file to `.env` (same folder) and fill in the real values.
# `.env` is gitignored. Never commit real keys.
#
# SCOPE: build/dev-time tooling only (media generation scripts and similar).
# These are NOT shipped to the browser.
#
# ⚠ Do NOT add a variable here whose name appears in the `define` block of
#   vite.config.ts - anything listed there is INLINED INTO THE PUBLIC JS BUNDLE
#   and would be readable by any visitor. Only the FIREBASE_* values belong
#   there; those are public client config by design.

# kie.ai - image + video generation (https://kie.ai/api-key)
# Sent as:  Authorization: Bearer <KIE_API_KEY>
# Models: https://kie.ai/market  (endpoint differs per model)
KIE_API_KEY=
